<title>FRANCE: Algerian &quot;terrorists&quot; kill 40 civilians - newspaper.</title>
<headline>Algerian &quot;terrorists&quot; kill 40 civilians - newspaper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suspected Moslem militants killed 33 villagers in an attack on an Algerian community at the weekend and seven other civilians at a fake road block nearby, an Algerian newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>El Watan daily, well informed on security matters, said around 20 Moslem rebels attacked Fetha village, near Ksar El Boukhari, southwest of Algiers, over Saturday-Sunday night. They killed 33 members of five families. The bodies of the seven others civilians were found in a nearby forest.</p>
</text>
